# Test the API without leaving VS Code. Install the "REST Client" extension, then click "Send Request" above a request.
@host = http://localhost:4000

### health: is the server + database alive?
GET {{host}}/api/health

### all reader groups
GET {{host}}/api/groups

### all books
GET {{host}}/api/books

### filtered: kids' books under $12.50, cheapest first
GET {{host}}/api/books?group=kids&max=12.5&sort=price_asc

### Kids Corner: bedtime books for ages 3 to 5
GET {{host}}/api/books?group=kids&category=bedtime&ageFrom=3&ageTo=5

### search
GET {{host}}/api/books?q=moon

### one book
GET {{host}}/api/books/moon-bakery

### protected route WITHOUT login -> must answer 401
GET {{host}}/api/cart

### newsletter
POST {{host}}/api/newsletter
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "test@example.com" }
